===Noun===
{{en-noun|passers-by}}

# A person who is [[pass by|passing by]] (that is, walking past).
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1963|author={{w|Margery Allingham}}|title={{w|The China Governess}}
|chapter=10|url=http://openlibrary.org/works/OL2004261W
|passage=With a little manœuvring they contrived to meet on the doorstep which was […] in a boiling stream of '''passers-by''', hurrying business people speeding past in a flurry of fumes and dust in the bright haze.}}
#: {{ux|en|When he tripped and fell in the street, several kind '''passers-by''' helped him up.}}

